  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In a qi path dream realm, after escaping pursuit and entering the second stage heavily injured, Fang Yuan finds moving dragon qi expended by over half and iron qi by half, while orchid vitality qi is still intact, so he decides to heal first. He silently prepares and activates the immortal killer move Orchid Breath; immortal essence feeds the move and a small portion of orchid vitality qi is expended at once. He gulps, his cheeks puff, and he opens his mouth; when the effect ends, his injuries are mostly recovered. In that dream he has only rank six qi flow Gu as an Immortal Gu, together with those three immortal materials: black iron qi for dark full body armor, orchid vitality qi to heal, and moving dragon qi for movement.",
